WEBVTT

00:00:12.304 --> 00:00:15.349
You only want to see
my blood spilled, right?

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:16.934
Hot Pot Kim!

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:19.645
Never call me by that name!

00:00:21.188 --> 00:00:23.649
Cecile, you bitch.

00:00:24.316 --> 00:00:31.281
You'd do well to remember this.
Now I'm known as Mr. Gold!

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:54.721
You're so reckless.

00:00:55.264 --> 00:00:57.432
You're lucky they were projections.

00:00:57.975 --> 00:00:59.977
You needn't worry about me.

00:01:01.311 --> 00:01:02.729
That man...

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:05.732
Mr. Hot Pot is back.

00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:42.579
Red Flame Recollection

00:02:49.169 --> 00:02:50.379
Huh?

00:02:50.712 --> 00:02:54.549
We were just about to have
Doug's welcome back party!

00:02:54.841 --> 00:02:57.094
I told you that's not necessary.

00:02:59.679 --> 00:03:03.058
The CEO of the Xiangin Corporation,
Edgar Kim.

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:04.976
I heard he was in charge of

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:07.771
the Emergency Management HQ
following the reactor incident.

00:03:08.105 --> 00:03:11.233
I remember. He's the one who exiled Leon.

00:03:15.237 --> 00:03:18.657
<i>Leon got a lot of criticism from people</i>
<i>when they found out</i>

00:03:19.157 --> 00:03:20.784
<i>he helped develop the reactor.</i>

00:03:21.493 --> 00:03:25.622
<i>Edgar attempted to control the situation</i>
<i>by exiling Leon.</i>

00:03:26.081 --> 00:03:29.000
<i>However, following this,</i>
<i>he opposed the princess</i>

00:03:29.084 --> 00:03:30.585
<i>and fell from his position.</i>

00:03:30.836 --> 00:03:33.880
<i>Then, along with his son, David Kim,</i>
<i>he left the city.</i>

00:03:35.382 --> 00:03:38.176
<i>David Kim is surely Mr. Gold.</i>

00:03:38.635 --> 00:03:41.221
<i>He's the mastermind</i>
<i>behind the Dark Drive incidents.</i>

00:03:43.432 --> 00:03:45.767
So, the one who gave Wang
the Dark Drive was...

00:03:46.476 --> 00:03:48.311
<i>Most likely Mr. Gold.</i>

00:03:48.395 --> 00:03:50.063
He's the one who set up Emilia.

00:03:51.398 --> 00:03:53.775
<i>He said he would steal the city from me.</i>

00:03:54.818 --> 00:03:56.862
So, he's after the reactor.

00:03:57.362 --> 00:03:59.781
You called him Mr. Hot Pot.

00:04:00.741 --> 00:04:04.661
<i>At the time, David was managing</i>
<i>a number of businesses in Xianglong.</i>

00:04:05.412 --> 00:04:08.248
<i>Among them was a chain restaurant</i>
<i>called Mr. Hot Pot.</i>

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:11.918
<i>They put way too much chili pepper</i>
<i>in their hot pots.</i>

00:04:12.878 --> 00:04:15.130
<i>The Dark Drive,</i>
<i>the man at the porcelain factory,</i>

00:04:15.213 --> 00:04:16.882
<i>and Gold's body.</i>

00:04:17.758 --> 00:04:20.677
<i>That kind of technology</i>
<i>is not something readily available.</i>

00:04:21.052 --> 00:04:22.971
<i>He must have someone helping him.</i>

00:04:23.722 --> 00:04:25.223
<i>Does anyone come to mind?</i>

00:04:27.267 --> 00:04:29.853
Not readily.
Ever since they left Neo Xianglong,

00:04:29.936 --> 00:04:33.231
we've had no idea where they are
or what they're doing.

00:04:33.982 --> 00:04:37.527
Can't you... Can't you stop the reactor?

00:04:38.361 --> 00:04:40.989
The BRAI are drawn towards the reactor,
aren't they?

00:04:41.364 --> 00:04:43.450
Gold is after it too. So...

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:46.870
Research is progressing,
but I haven't found a way to control it.

00:04:46.953 --> 00:04:48.371
Then let's destroy it!

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:51.708
<i>In order for the absolute-defense system</i>
<i>to function,</i>

00:04:51.958 --> 00:04:53.794
<i>we need the energy from the reactor.</i>

00:04:54.294 --> 00:04:57.631
<i>If it were destroyed,</i>
<i>the evolutionary field would remain</i>

00:04:57.714 --> 00:04:59.591
<i>and the BRAI would still threaten us.</i>

00:04:59.966 --> 00:05:02.552
<i>How long are we going to be tormented</i>

00:05:02.969 --> 00:05:05.305
<i>by some mysterious thing</i>
<i>made by outsiders?!</i>

00:05:05.722 --> 00:05:09.226
<i>To make matters worse,</i>
<i>we're paying outsiders to protect us.</i>

00:05:09.392 --> 00:05:12.312
<i>Do you know how many starving people</i>
<i>there are in the city?</i>

00:05:12.979 --> 00:05:15.273
You want to dismantle Pandora too?

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:18.902
At the very least, we won't have
to get mixed up with these hitmen.

00:05:19.236 --> 00:05:21.196
Why is he still here?

00:05:22.405 --> 00:05:23.907
Because he's useful.

00:05:24.866 --> 00:05:26.493
Such kind words.

00:05:27.536 --> 00:05:31.248
<i>Many of our citizens were involved</i>
<i>in the construction of the reactor.</i>

00:05:33.041 --> 00:05:34.918
<i>Laborers came from afar</i>

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:38.171
<i>and the city was like a procurement center</i>
<i>for the reactor.</i>

00:05:38.797 --> 00:05:41.299
<i>Numerous people benefited</i>
<i>from its construction.</i>

00:05:42.676 --> 00:05:45.845
<i>A portion of those people</i>
<i>may be helping Gold</i>

00:05:46.388 --> 00:05:48.682
<i>in hopes that they again reap the rewards.</i>

00:05:49.808 --> 00:05:51.726
<i>Outsiders are not our only enemies.</i>

00:05:52.602 --> 00:05:54.521
<i>There will surely be another attack.</i>

00:05:55.355 --> 00:05:58.149
<i>Be prepared to repel it</i>
<i>whenever it happens.</i>

00:06:02.988 --> 00:06:06.199
Success! Congratulations!

00:06:06.408 --> 00:06:09.202
Your world begins now, Mr. Gold!

00:06:10.036 --> 00:06:12.831
The world where BRAI control humans!

00:06:13.248 --> 00:06:15.750
A new show is about to begin!

00:06:16.251 --> 00:06:19.462
And the one who will control the BRAI...

00:06:19.963 --> 00:06:21.631
will be me!

00:06:41.484 --> 00:06:42.485
Dad!

00:06:43.903 --> 00:06:44.904
Mom!

00:06:45.238 --> 00:06:46.239
Gren?

00:06:46.364 --> 00:06:47.240
What is it?

00:06:49.743 --> 00:06:51.995
Dad... Mom...

00:07:06.259 --> 00:07:07.802
Lon! Lon!

00:07:09.638 --> 00:07:10.639
It can't be...

00:07:33.495 --> 00:07:35.413
Is that you...

00:07:35.497 --> 00:07:37.415
Miss...Fiona?

00:07:38.875 --> 00:07:40.293
Do you see something?

00:07:41.002 --> 00:07:43.254
The night sky. The moon and the stars...

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:48.677
All I can see is fog.

00:07:49.928 --> 00:07:52.639
Star, star. Moon, moon.

00:07:52.722 --> 00:07:55.642
Star, star. Moon, moon.

00:07:55.892 --> 00:07:58.269
They spin round and round.

00:07:59.562 --> 00:08:01.856
Which night sky are you looking at?

00:08:02.857 --> 00:08:03.858
Huh?

00:08:09.155 --> 00:08:10.156
What...

00:08:12.158 --> 00:08:13.451
Which night sky?

00:08:17.038 --> 00:08:19.749
<i>How long is Doug's MOEV going to take?</i>

00:08:20.041 --> 00:08:22.043
<i>Two days or so.</i>

00:08:23.336 --> 00:08:24.921
All right, I'll leave it to you.

00:08:25.005 --> 00:08:26.506
Drinking too much again?

00:08:26.589 --> 00:08:28.925
Wasn't your salary cut?

00:08:29.009 --> 00:08:32.345
Yeah, and this sorry state I'm in
is due to all the cheap booze.

00:08:32.554 --> 00:08:34.806
Won't you look after me, Queenie?

00:08:35.056 --> 00:08:36.683
Let's leave it at that.

00:08:37.267 --> 00:08:40.311
Three of the MOEVs
are equipped with hyperdrive.

00:08:41.229 --> 00:08:43.148
<i>But they're still very risky.</i>

00:08:44.024 --> 00:08:47.444
Which is why I'm thinking of installing
a safety system.

00:08:47.902 --> 00:08:49.154
A safety system?

00:08:50.780 --> 00:08:52.532
Using our brain wave data,

00:08:52.824 --> 00:08:56.494
I'll program the hyperdrive to shut down
when a certain danger threshold is...

00:08:58.621 --> 00:08:59.622
Gren?

00:09:00.248 --> 00:09:03.084
What's wrong, kid?
Were you lonely by yourself?

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:10.091
Brainiac... I mean, Leon Lau!

00:09:10.675 --> 00:09:15.388
Install a hyperdrive on my MOEV, too!
Please!

00:09:15.555 --> 00:09:16.556
Huh?

00:09:17.057 --> 00:09:18.767
I want to protect this city!

00:09:20.101 --> 00:09:21.102
I'm begging you.

00:09:22.562 --> 00:09:23.897
I can't do that.

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:29.152
You were deemed incompatible
in experiments in the past.

00:09:29.986 --> 00:09:31.529
Then try it out again!

00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:35.408
Both Queenie and Doug
were successful on the first try.

00:09:36.618 --> 00:09:40.038
The hyperdrive resonates
with the deep consciousness of the pilot.

00:09:40.413 --> 00:09:43.500
I believe it's activated
when the pilot's willpower increases.

00:09:49.047 --> 00:09:51.549
Are you saying I have
less willpower than them?

00:09:51.633 --> 00:09:53.718
-Calm down, Sarge.
-Shut up!

00:09:54.094 --> 00:09:55.095
Gren.

00:09:56.554 --> 00:09:58.389
You are at higher risk than them

00:09:58.765 --> 00:10:02.477
of suffering a mental breakdown
or losing control, by my estimation.

00:10:03.228 --> 00:10:05.105
I don't care what happens to my life!

00:10:05.355 --> 00:10:07.065
It would cause trouble for others.

00:10:08.274 --> 00:10:12.028
-You little...
-I've already destroyed the world once.

00:10:12.654 --> 00:10:15.406
I cannot repeat the same mistake again.

00:10:21.329 --> 00:10:24.040
That's enough for today. Work calls.

00:10:25.416 --> 00:10:28.711
Unidentified BRAI!
East-northeast, 120 kilometers.

00:10:28.962 --> 00:10:30.880
Approaching at 70 kilometers per hour.

00:10:31.339 --> 00:10:32.715
Quantum energy detected.

00:10:33.091 --> 00:10:35.301
Its Dark Drive has already been activated.

00:10:35.718 --> 00:10:36.803
The BRAI's size is...

00:10:38.054 --> 00:10:40.140
700 meters in total?!

00:10:40.723 --> 00:10:41.724
But how?

00:10:43.226 --> 00:10:44.519
700 meters?

00:10:46.938 --> 00:10:48.731
Dispatch of Pandora approved.

00:10:49.482 --> 00:10:51.609
Support the city's defense troops.

00:10:52.110 --> 00:10:54.988
<i>Pandora One, Pandora Three, launch!</i>

00:10:55.738 --> 00:10:58.074
<i>Catapult rising. Standby for launch.</i>

00:11:10.753 --> 00:11:13.089
<i>Captain Gren has joined</i>
<i>the city's defense troops.</i>

00:11:13.756 --> 00:11:15.216
<i>Standby for orders.</i>

00:11:16.885 --> 00:11:20.221
All this new technology
and I can't even use it!

00:11:20.555 --> 00:11:21.556
Shit!

00:11:24.559 --> 00:11:25.602
It's huge.

00:11:27.478 --> 00:11:28.646
That can't be.

00:11:29.647 --> 00:11:30.648
What?

00:11:33.902 --> 00:11:35.069
No way!

00:11:38.364 --> 00:11:39.365
A colony?

00:11:41.784 --> 00:11:42.785
<i>Bees?</i>

00:11:43.077 --> 00:11:46.581
It's a swarm.
A swarm of countless BRAI bees!

00:11:48.291 --> 00:11:50.919
<i>Countless BRAI bees! Gren!</i>

00:11:51.294 --> 00:11:54.255
<i>Be careful.</i>
<i>They're headed straight for Neo Xianglong!</i>

00:11:55.256 --> 00:11:57.133
For Neo Xianglong!

00:12:00.011 --> 00:12:03.014
<i>The micro-BRAI have penetrated</i>
<i>the absolute-defense system!</i>

00:12:04.140 --> 00:12:07.977
<i>It seems...they're emitting intense heat</i>
<i>and melting the water pipes!</i>

00:12:09.854 --> 00:12:10.855
Intense heat?

00:12:11.189 --> 00:12:13.441
<i>The heat generated by their beating wings</i>

00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:17.153
<i>is fed into the Dark Drive and</i>
<i>amplified through multiple dimensions!</i>

00:12:20.531 --> 00:12:21.866
Damn!

00:12:23.117 --> 00:12:24.118
What's that?

00:12:24.452 --> 00:12:25.453
The queen bee!

00:12:28.414 --> 00:12:29.624
It's...

00:12:35.338 --> 00:12:36.422
I won't let you in!

00:12:40.051 --> 00:12:41.052
<i>What's wrong?</i>

00:12:42.679 --> 00:12:45.556
The micro-BRAI are attaching themselves
to the hyperdrive.

00:12:47.809 --> 00:12:49.686
Shit! Are they ignoring me?!

00:12:50.061 --> 00:12:51.771
<i>Quickly, activate the hyperdrive!</i>

00:12:52.021 --> 00:12:53.690
I've been trying but...

00:12:53.982 --> 00:12:56.484
the micro-BRAI are preventing me
from transforming!

00:12:59.612 --> 00:13:01.781
The intense heat is disrupting our psyche,

00:13:01.864 --> 00:13:04.075
and keeping us from syncing
with the hyperdrive.

00:13:08.329 --> 00:13:10.081
The temperature in the city is rising!

00:13:10.331 --> 00:13:11.708
It's currently 36 degrees!

00:13:13.751 --> 00:13:15.712
<i>If it continues along this route...</i>

00:13:16.629 --> 00:13:18.673
it'll reach the underground water supply!

00:13:19.340 --> 00:13:20.967
It's not headed to the reactor?

00:13:21.676 --> 00:13:24.387
<i>There's something embedded</i>
<i>in the queen BRAI's head.</i>

00:13:25.179 --> 00:13:28.391
<i>It's being controlled by</i>
<i>multidimensional bypass transmission!</i>

00:13:28.766 --> 00:13:33.438
<i>So, Gold is controlling the queen,</i>
<i>and she controls her children.</i>

00:13:33.688 --> 00:13:35.481
<i>The heated water and air</i>

00:13:35.565 --> 00:13:38.276
<i>are being spread around the city</i>
<i>through the pipelines!</i>

00:13:38.901 --> 00:13:41.904
<i>If the water in the underground</i>
<i>water supply heats up further...</i>

00:13:42.822 --> 00:13:46.242
Neo Xianglong will become a hot pot.

00:13:47.243 --> 00:13:49.912
The BRAI has arrived
at the underground water supply!

00:14:25.782 --> 00:14:27.367
Mr. Hot Pot...

00:14:30.745 --> 00:14:33.414
I have total control of the BRAI.

00:14:34.082 --> 00:14:38.920
However, would it not have been better
to just destroy the entire defense system?

00:14:39.253 --> 00:14:41.172
That would have lacked artistry.

00:14:44.842 --> 00:14:47.595
I hope that pretentious bitch
of a princess

00:14:48.012 --> 00:14:51.057
boils alive in that hot pot!

00:15:04.904 --> 00:15:05.863
Princess!

00:15:06.030 --> 00:15:08.658
All hands, get business casual at once!

00:15:15.748 --> 00:15:17.041
My cooling fan is done for!

00:15:17.125 --> 00:15:18.709
<i>Isn't there anything we can do?</i>

00:15:19.377 --> 00:15:20.545
Judging from its size,

00:15:20.628 --> 00:15:24.132
the Dark Drive is most likely
inside the queen bee.

00:15:24.841 --> 00:15:26.759
If we could just bring down the queen...

00:15:27.051 --> 00:15:28.052
<i>Let me handle it!</i>

00:15:29.178 --> 00:15:30.721
Even without a hyperdrive,

00:15:31.055 --> 00:15:33.224
I can get to the underground
water supply!

00:15:33.516 --> 00:15:35.643
<i>Your MOEV is no match for the BRAI.</i>

00:15:36.227 --> 00:15:39.230
With your size, you can't
get down there in the first place!

00:15:39.397 --> 00:15:41.399
<i>There's an underground tunnel</i>
<i>that was used</i>

00:15:41.482 --> 00:15:42.859
<i>when the reactor was built.</i>

00:15:43.401 --> 00:15:47.113
<i>However, the maps were lost in the crisis.</i>

00:15:48.114 --> 00:15:49.407
I know the way.

00:15:50.324 --> 00:15:51.742
I...

00:15:51.993 --> 00:15:55.121
I... I worked there!

00:15:59.667 --> 00:16:00.877
<i>There is no other way.</i>

00:16:01.502 --> 00:16:02.920
<i>What do you think, Secretary?</i>

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:04.881
Permission granted.

00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:09.760
<i>Take it down, Captain Gren!</i>

00:16:10.803 --> 00:16:13.473
Roger that!
I, Captain Gren Din,

00:16:13.764 --> 00:16:16.851
will head to the old underground
reactor construction tunnel!

00:16:20.229 --> 00:16:21.689
Give it your all.

00:16:22.648 --> 00:16:26.944
Do it for your parents
and siblings who died in the crisis.

00:16:31.908 --> 00:16:34.911
The city's temperature
has risen to 47 degrees.

00:16:35.077 --> 00:16:36.579
48 degrees!

00:16:37.497 --> 00:16:40.041
Pandora Four approaching
underground water supply.

00:16:40.124 --> 00:16:42.585
500 meters... 480 meters...

00:16:46.172 --> 00:16:47.381
<i>I've passed point five.</i>

00:16:48.090 --> 00:16:51.010
<i>I'll now descend through</i>
<i>the equipment transport elevator.</i>

00:16:54.430 --> 00:16:56.224
The temperature in the base is rising!

00:16:56.432 --> 00:16:58.976
52 degrees... 52.5 degrees...

00:17:02.772 --> 00:17:05.274
70 meters... 50 meters...

00:17:05.942 --> 00:17:09.153
Pandora Four has arrived
at the underground water supply facility!

00:17:12.782 --> 00:17:14.367
I've arrived at the water supply!

00:17:14.867 --> 00:17:16.994
<i>No micro-BRAIs in sight.</i>

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:20.122
Gren Din, commencing raid!

00:17:26.879 --> 00:17:27.880
There it is!

00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:31.842
A-Aim for the control unit...

00:17:32.635 --> 00:17:34.470
in the head!

00:17:35.012 --> 00:17:36.264
Roger that!

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:49.151
Shit!

00:17:54.031 --> 00:17:57.618
This is... for Neo Xianglong!

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:05.001
Sarge!

00:18:05.084 --> 00:18:06.002
Gren!

00:18:08.629 --> 00:18:10.715
G-- Gren...

00:18:10.965 --> 00:18:12.133
<i>Gren! Gren!</i>

00:18:12.216 --> 00:18:13.884
<i>Sarge! Hey, sarge!</i>

00:18:14.093 --> 00:18:15.678
<i>Gren! Are you alive?</i>

00:18:15.803 --> 00:18:17.305
<i>Captain, respond!</i>

00:18:17.388 --> 00:18:19.015
<i>Gren! Gren!</i>

00:18:20.850 --> 00:18:22.018
<i>Dad, Mom!</i>

00:18:22.810 --> 00:18:25.271
I told you,
you don't need to work like this anymore!

00:18:25.354 --> 00:18:27.189
You know about the reactor, right?

00:18:27.607 --> 00:18:29.233
It's good money.

00:18:29.317 --> 00:18:30.901
I'll make your lives easier!

00:18:31.152 --> 00:18:32.153
Okay?

00:18:32.236 --> 00:18:33.237
Gren...

00:18:41.078 --> 00:18:42.079
Dad...

00:18:43.789 --> 00:18:44.790
Mom...

00:18:47.418 --> 00:18:48.544
<i>-Gren!</i>
<i>-Sarge!</i>

00:18:48.628 --> 00:18:50.504
<i>-Gren!</i>
<i>-Captain! Do you read?</i>

00:18:50.755 --> 00:18:52.965
<i>Gren! Gren! Respond!</i>

00:18:54.258 --> 00:18:56.761
How... lame...

00:18:58.929 --> 00:19:01.307
<i>All I did was rebel a little.</i>

00:19:01.849 --> 00:19:04.477
I'm the same... as the outsiders...

00:19:05.519 --> 00:19:07.229
trying to profit from the reactor.

00:19:08.022 --> 00:19:10.816
<i>I'm an idiot. A huge idiot.</i>

00:19:11.525 --> 00:19:12.526
Gren...

00:19:12.818 --> 00:19:15.363
<i>But, in this town...</i>

00:19:15.696 --> 00:19:17.406
<i>My mom and dad...</i>

00:19:18.783 --> 00:19:22.036
<i>my older and younger brothers...</i>
<i>Were all laid to rest here!</i>

00:19:23.371 --> 00:19:24.830
For Neo Xianglong...

00:19:27.458 --> 00:19:31.754
For Neo Xianglong!

00:19:50.815 --> 00:19:53.984
The queen BRAI's control has... weakened.

00:19:54.985 --> 00:19:55.986
Gren...

00:20:18.426 --> 00:20:21.011
Go for it! Leon!

00:20:38.279 --> 00:20:39.613
I'm not finished yet!

00:20:52.209 --> 00:20:53.544
You're late!

00:20:54.545 --> 00:20:56.714
Come on, Brainiac!

00:20:58.632 --> 00:21:00.760
Go to hell!

00:21:15.191 --> 00:21:16.192
<i>Gren!</i>

00:21:19.028 --> 00:21:20.279
How was that?

00:21:20.362 --> 00:21:23.407
I'll be the one
who protects Neo Xianglong.

00:21:24.116 --> 00:21:26.118
<i>Don't forget that, Leon Lau!</i>

00:21:26.619 --> 00:21:27.620
Got it.

00:21:29.455 --> 00:21:30.706
Captain Gren.

00:22:11.413 --> 00:22:12.790
He's the one who...

00:23:46.884 --> 00:23:50.387
DR. LON WOO

00:23:50.471 --> 00:23:51.889
